WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.020
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.290 --> 00:29.250
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.520 --> 00:32.950
[Episode 11]

4
00:42.090 --> 00:43.210
What brings you here

5
00:43.210 --> 00:44.360
today?

6
00:52.960 --> 00:54.670
I've been wearing this gold bean

7
00:54.670 --> 00:56.750
since I was born.

8
00:58.030 --> 00:59.350
My mom told me

9
00:59.350 --> 01:01.030
if it weren't for a savior

10
01:01.030 --> 01:02.960
who blocked the car for her back then,

11
01:02.960 --> 01:04.040
I wouldn't have had the chance

12
01:04.040 --> 01:05.370
to come into this world.

13
01:06.950 --> 01:07.870
This gold bean

14
01:08.350 --> 01:10.280
was also given to me by that savior.

15
01:10.770 --> 01:13.030
Later, we always wanted to see her again,

16
01:13.070 --> 01:14.600
but we could never find her.

17
01:23.039 --> 01:24.120
If you came to see me today

18
01:24.120 --> 01:26.640
to tell a story from before you were born,

19
01:27.120 --> 01:27.710
I might…

20
01:27.710 --> 01:29.560
But how could she not be found?

21
01:31.120 --> 01:32.310
Could it be

22
01:33.000 --> 01:35.120
that she used a fake identity?

23
01:44.150 --> 01:45.759
It's strange, too.

24
01:46.130 --> 01:48.729
The impact of that car crash back then was huge,

25
01:49.280 --> 01:50.640
yet she survived.

26
01:58.950 --> 01:59.710
Song Yiqiu.

27
02:01.310 --> 02:03.110
Why does the person in this photo

28
02:03.480 --> 02:05.120
look exactly like you?

29
02:17.120 --> 02:17.840
There are

30
02:17.840 --> 02:19.910
plenty of people in this world who look alike.

31
02:19.910 --> 02:21.240
You don't actually think

32
02:21.240 --> 02:23.120
that I'm your savior, do you?

33
02:26.400 --> 02:27.150
Right.

34
02:29.190 --> 02:31.790
There really are a lot of people who look alike.

35
02:37.990 --> 02:40.060
Lately, some fragmented images

36
02:40.680 --> 02:42.120
that don't belong to this era

37
02:42.120 --> 02:44.430
have inexplicably kept appearing

38
02:45.430 --> 02:47.240
in my mind.

39
02:48.910 --> 02:50.910
At first, I thought they were dreams

40
02:51.079 --> 02:52.210
or hallucinations.

41
02:53.030 --> 02:54.960
But it wasn't until I saw this photo

42
02:55.620 --> 02:58.220
that I realized they weren't hallucinations.

43
02:58.630 --> 03:00.960
And I'm not just Lin Huai of this lifetime.

44
03:01.990 --> 03:03.780
We knew each other before.

45
03:04.630 --> 03:05.470
You even

46
03:06.960 --> 03:08.840
saved me in a past life.

47
03:10.240 --> 03:12.240
Do you really not remember any of it?

48
03:14.190 --> 03:15.660
There's a sniper. Go!

49
03:20.410 --> 03:21.870
Don't stick your head out.

50
03:21.960 --> 03:22.750
They didn't succeed.

51
03:22.750 --> 03:23.710
They'll come for you again.

52
03:23.710 --> 03:24.800
Run!

53
03:25.230 --> 03:26.350
Run!

54
03:26.370 --> 03:27.900
No, I'm not leaving.

55
03:53.520 --> 03:54.320
You're awake?

56
03:57.590 --> 03:58.630
That student.

57
03:59.520 --> 04:00.520
Is he still alive?

58
04:00.840 --> 04:01.570
Don't worry.

59
04:02.870 --> 04:03.670
He's not dead.

60
04:06.590 --> 04:07.360
That's good.

61
04:08.030 --> 04:09.160
I'll go check on him.

62
04:17.950 --> 04:18.680
Who is he?

63
04:19.399 --> 04:21.260
Is he worth it for you, Song Yiqiu,

64
04:23.180 --> 04:24.510
actually, Song Baiwei,

65
04:25.120 --> 04:27.040
to have your heart pierced through

66
04:27.040 --> 04:29.040
and your lungs shredded by bullets,

67
04:29.450 --> 04:31.710
yet still worry about his life and death?

68
04:37.310 --> 04:38.710
I can't explain it to you.

69
04:42.600 --> 04:44.360
If I hadn't arrived fast enough,

70
04:44.360 --> 04:46.390
you and that student would be dead already.

71
04:46.390 --> 04:46.950
And

72
04:47.270 --> 04:48.510
all the reporters in Shanghai

73
04:48.510 --> 04:49.720
are waiting outside Ning Mansion

74
04:49.720 --> 04:51.560
to see how your wound healed

75
04:51.560 --> 04:53.220
and how you rose from the dead.

76
04:53.310 --> 04:53.950
You put yourself

77
04:53.950 --> 04:55.600
under everyone's flashbulbs.

78
04:55.600 --> 04:57.600
You'll be dissected like a monster.

79
04:58.190 --> 04:59.800
In these three thousand years,

80
04:59.800 --> 05:01.830
haven't you suffered enough for this?

81
05:01.830 --> 05:03.190
The land was torn apart.

82
05:03.720 --> 05:04.870
Dynasties changed.

83
05:05.240 --> 05:06.640
Haven't you seen enough?

84
05:06.960 --> 05:08.890
Can you really save so many people?

85
05:11.120 --> 05:12.320
I can't save them all.

86
05:13.910 --> 05:15.860
But I'll save as many as I can.

87
05:21.480 --> 05:23.680
It's because I've seen too much death

88
05:24.040 --> 05:26.510
that I know how precious it is to live.

89
05:27.930 --> 05:29.460
You used to be like this too.

90
05:31.950 --> 05:32.880
You've changed.

91
05:42.360 --> 05:43.510
That Ning Changyue

92
05:45.430 --> 05:46.490
can't protect you.

93
05:54.730 --> 05:56.090
Starting today,

94
05:57.370 --> 05:58.430
you will stay here.

95
05:59.000 --> 06:00.930
You are not allowed to go anywhere.

96
06:02.320 --> 06:03.530
You want to lock me up?

97
06:09.210 --> 06:10.670
It's for your protection.

98
06:25.170 --> 06:26.930
Extra! Extra!

99
06:26.960 --> 06:28.900
Commander Ning kills five innocent patrol officers

100
06:28.900 --> 06:31.100
in a fit of rage to protect his wife.

101
06:31.480 --> 06:33.000
Extra! Extra!

102
06:33.000 --> 06:34.420
Commander Ning kills…

103
06:50.070 --> 06:51.630
I want to see Commander Ning!

104
06:51.630 --> 06:52.890
Sorry, you can't go in.

105
06:53.390 --> 06:54.680
Calm down. You can't go in!

106
06:54.680 --> 06:55.920
Let me in!

107
06:55.920 --> 06:56.720
Commander,

108
06:57.120 --> 06:59.220
Patrol Officer Chen Gensheng's family won't leave.

109
06:59.220 --> 06:59.900
Let her in.

110
07:00.120 --> 07:01.600
I'll handle the family.

111
07:01.600 --> 07:01.950
You don't need to…

112
07:01.950 --> 07:02.600
Let her in.

113
07:03.560 --> 07:04.000
Yes, Sir.

114
07:04.000 --> 07:05.800
Commander Ning!

115
07:05.800 --> 07:06.920
You can't go in. You really can't.

116
07:06.920 --> 07:07.850
Commander Ning!

117
07:08.750 --> 07:09.630
Let her in.

118
07:10.240 --> 07:10.750
Here.

119
07:16.720 --> 07:17.650
Commander Ning.

120
07:17.970 --> 07:20.320
What the newspaper says isn't true, is it?

121
07:21.220 --> 07:22.860
That day, my son

122
07:22.880 --> 07:26.000
was just following the order to disperse the students.

123
07:26.070 --> 07:26.750
He…

124
07:26.750 --> 07:29.510
He didn't even carry a gun.

125
07:29.560 --> 07:31.190
He didn't do anything wrong.

126
07:31.730 --> 07:34.000
He didn't kill anyone.

127
07:34.360 --> 07:36.409
Commander Ning, I beg you.

128
07:36.710 --> 07:38.220
I beg for your mercy.

129
07:39.190 --> 07:41.650
-Please release him. -Give her the pension.

130
07:43.680 --> 07:44.750
Pension?

131
07:44.920 --> 07:45.510
No!

132
07:45.700 --> 07:47.580
My son is not dead!

133
07:47.610 --> 07:49.200
He's still in prison!

134
07:49.220 --> 07:50.150
Give her double.

135
07:51.390 --> 07:53.040
I don't want money!

136
07:53.040 --> 07:54.800
I want my son!

137
07:54.800 --> 07:56.360
I want my son!

138
07:56.750 --> 07:58.680
Give me back my son!

139
07:58.680 --> 08:00.750
You killed my son!

140
08:00.750 --> 08:02.310
You butcher!

141
08:02.310 --> 08:04.360
I want you to die a horrible death!

142
08:04.360 --> 08:06.360
I'll take you down with me!

143
08:08.000 --> 08:08.630
Granny!

144
08:09.360 --> 08:09.950
Granny!

145
08:10.720 --> 08:11.360
Granny!

146
08:12.160 --> 08:14.830
Take her to the hospital! Hurry!

147
08:14.890 --> 08:15.400
Somebody!

148
08:15.400 --> 08:16.040
Hurry!

149
08:17.390 --> 08:18.070
Granny.

150
08:20.270 --> 08:20.800
Let's go.

151
08:21.120 --> 08:21.850
Take it slow.

152
08:23.070 --> 08:23.750
Be careful.

153
08:25.510 --> 08:26.840
To the hospital. Hurry!

154
08:42.230 --> 08:43.830
How many times has this been?

155
08:45.530 --> 08:46.900
[Commander Ning kills five innocent patrol officer]

156
08:46.900 --> 08:48.280
[in a fit of rage to protect his wife]

157
08:48.430 --> 08:49.880
What is this now?

158
08:56.150 --> 08:57.240
Explain.

159
08:58.340 --> 09:00.000
Explain that you didn't know.

160
09:02.390 --> 09:04.450
Explain that you did so to protect me.

161
09:04.610 --> 09:06.090
Explain that they were in the wrong,

162
09:06.090 --> 09:08.000
and you just did the right thing.

163
09:09.000 --> 09:10.440
Explain it!

164
09:18.910 --> 09:21.170
I'm investigating who tried to kill you.

165
09:21.200 --> 09:22.720
They obviously came prepared.

166
09:22.720 --> 09:23.870
It's very dangerous.

167
09:23.870 --> 09:24.320
So I must…

168
09:24.320 --> 09:25.250
Very dangerous.

169
09:27.060 --> 09:29.790
So you'd rather kill these five innocent people.

170
09:31.060 --> 09:31.940
Ning Changyue.

171
09:33.510 --> 09:34.600
Now you've climbed step by step

172
09:34.600 --> 09:36.200
to the position you wanted.

173
09:37.480 --> 09:39.030
These five lives mean nothing to you,

174
09:39.030 --> 09:40.550
just ants, is that it?

175
09:43.120 --> 09:44.150
Commander Ning.

176
09:45.030 --> 09:46.720
Treating human lives like weeds.

177
09:46.720 --> 09:48.150
Abusing your power.

178
09:48.840 --> 09:51.550
Is this your so-called protection?

179
10:27.080 --> 10:28.210
Where are you going?

180
10:28.670 --> 10:29.670
I'm leaving here.

181
10:30.080 --> 10:31.390
It's very dangerous outside right now.

182
10:31.390 --> 10:32.120
At any moment, you could…

183
10:32.120 --> 10:32.750
Die,

184
10:34.000 --> 10:36.060
or be treated as an immortal monster?

185
10:41.320 --> 10:42.180
Ning Changyue.

186
10:43.200 --> 10:44.550
I'm not afraid of these.

187
10:45.120 --> 10:47.000
What I'm afraid of is that you let more people

188
10:47.000 --> 10:49.730
die under your power in the name of protecting me.

189
10:56.330 --> 10:57.190
Ning Changyue.

190
10:59.370 --> 11:01.430
If I had known I would end up like this,

191
11:01.970 --> 11:04.770
I would rather have died in Southern Qin back then.

192
11:25.040 --> 11:29.010
[Tomb of Mr. Chen Gensheng]

193
11:56.390 --> 12:00.380
[Tomb of Ms. Song Baiwei]

194
12:13.320 --> 12:14.150
Turn it over.

195
12:24.630 --> 12:25.390
Song…

196
12:26.200 --> 12:27.010
Baiwei?

197
12:48.790 --> 12:49.790
It really is you.

198
12:51.270 --> 12:52.240
You were shot in the heart.

199
12:52.240 --> 12:53.840
You couldn't have survived.

200
12:54.320 --> 12:54.790
Are you

201
12:55.120 --> 12:56.270
a human

202
12:57.030 --> 12:58.480
or a ghost?

203
12:59.970 --> 13:01.060
Did you erect this?

204
13:06.260 --> 13:07.810
Song Baiwei.

205
13:07.910 --> 13:10.320
I didn't expect that in your few short decades of life,

206
13:10.320 --> 13:12.050
someone would sincerely

207
13:12.750 --> 13:14.210
erect a tombstone for you.

208
13:16.160 --> 13:16.890
That's nice.

209
13:33.680 --> 13:34.760
Apples are okay.

210
13:35.690 --> 13:36.780
I don't like pears.

211
13:49.610 --> 13:52.020
You came to visit a grave with just a newspaper?

212
13:52.020 --> 13:53.680
Are you trying to fool a ghost?

213
13:54.390 --> 13:55.390
No, no, no.

214
13:55.720 --> 13:57.580
That day, I thought you were dead.

215
13:57.630 --> 13:58.510
In your briefcase,

216
13:58.510 --> 14:00.120
I saw your name, Song Baiwei,

217
14:00.120 --> 14:01.200
and the sketches.

218
14:01.630 --> 14:02.360
Then,

219
14:02.740 --> 14:04.340
I sent them to the newspaper.

220
14:04.670 --> 14:05.510
Take a look.

221
14:23.870 --> 14:24.790
It's him.

222
14:34.630 --> 14:36.240
Thank you, Lin.

223
14:36.630 --> 14:37.670
I didn't expect these drawings

224
14:37.670 --> 14:39.730
to end up being sent to the newspaper.

225
14:40.270 --> 14:41.080
It's nothing.

226
14:41.790 --> 14:42.910
My pleasure.

227
14:51.600 --> 14:53.000
I'll repay your kindness

228
14:53.350 --> 14:54.710
in my next life.

229
15:03.120 --> 15:04.980
Since you think I'm already dead,

230
15:06.390 --> 15:07.790
then I'll just be a ghost.

231
15:15.550 --> 15:18.100
[One month later]

232
15:19.740 --> 15:21.050
Excuse me. Excuse me.

233
15:25.470 --> 15:26.380
Miss, do you need a ride?

234
15:26.380 --> 15:27.510
It's cheap and fast.

235
15:32.360 --> 15:33.000
To the newspaper office.

236
15:33.000 --> 15:34.390
Okay. Let's go.

237
15:41.080 --> 15:41.720
Thank you.

238
15:52.510 --> 15:53.080
Miss.

239
15:53.790 --> 15:55.720
Do ghosts have to pay for a ride too?

240
15:58.900 --> 15:59.850
Song Yiqiu.

241
16:00.270 --> 16:02.200
I've already guessed your secret.

242
16:03.150 --> 16:04.360
But in my heart,

243
16:04.710 --> 16:05.950
you will always be Song Baiwei.
